  "backstoryCard": {
    "backstoryNotes": "The five members of Seekers of Stolen Light forged their collective bond while exploring a ruined, dark-matter research station adrift near the outer rim. Deep within the wreck, the flock uncovered the glowing remnant of a shattered ancient star-core—a strange, encapsulated anomaly emitting light from a long-dead era. Fascinated by the discovery and driven by an intense corvid instinct to hoard lost wonders and shiny relics, the five minds unified under a single shared purpose: tracking down fragments of lost light-based tech and stellar artifacts hidden across the Great Ring. Seekers of Stolen Light is a unified flock unit of five crow-like avian bipeds, each standing around 1'4\" with glossy, pitch-black plumage that shimmers with an oily violet and silver sheen under starlight. They move with eerie, fluid synchronicity, often perching in formation on high ledges or walking in a tight, coordinated cluster."
  },
